        "original_id": "1aee6b19-7d05-51f2-86f8-781e5b27093d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Homer Simpson, Principal Seymour Skinner, Selma, Patty, Hans Moleman, Harry Shearer, Matt Groening, Dan Castellaneta\n- Works: The Simpsons, “Principal Charming”\n- Concepts: fictional characters, voice actors, character origins\n\nFacts:\n- In “Principal Charming,” Homer Simpson invites Principal Seymour Skinner to dinner, but Skinner falls for Patty instead of Selma.\n- Principal Seymour Skinner is a fictional character in the American animated sitcom The Simpsons.\n- Principal Seymour Skinner was born Armin Tamzarian.\n- Harry Shearer voices Principal Seymour Skinner.\n- Hans Moleman was created by The Simpsons series creator Matt Groening.\n- Hans Moleman is voiced by Dan Castellaneta.\n- Hans Moleman first appeared in the episode “Principal Charming.”",
